#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/grdgradient.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.grdgradient.grdgradient:118
msgid ""
"**c**\\|\\ **r**\\|\\ **R**. Control how normalization via ``normalize`` is "
"carried out. When multiple grids should be normalized the same way (i.e., "
"with the same *offset* and/or *sigma*), we must pass these values via "
"``normalize``. However, this is inconvenient if we compute these values from "
"a grid. Use **c** to save the results of *offset* and *sigma* to a "
"statistics file; if grid output is not needed for this run then do not "
"specify ``outgrid``. For subsequent runs, just use **r** to read these "
"values. Using **R** will read then delete the statistics file."
msgstr ""

